{"1975350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Insectoid Descent", "steam_appid": 1975350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mysterious Lore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genetically modified insectoids are the product of an isolated top-secret research base.  As a consequence of experimentation, a mutation enabled the bugs to break captivity.  They began replicating exponentially and have annihilated the facility.  Your team has been dispatched to prepare the site for cleanup, an extermination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sandbox Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play the game while spawning in explosive barrels, more enemies, teleporting around and regenerating your health.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Speed Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play the game on hyper-speed mode, where everything moves a lot faster.  Interesting challenge for speedrunning!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Detailed World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Destructible Walls</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Hazardous Machinery</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Climb Fences</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Door Crushing</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Red Explosive Barrels</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-More to discover</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mysterious Lore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genetically modified insectoids are the product of an isolated top-secret research base.  As a consequence of experimentation, a mutation enabled the bugs to break captivity.  They began replicating exponentially and have annihilated the facility.  Your team has been dispatched to prepare the sit